      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ANOTHER NEPHEW (5) was a narrow winner two back at Port Hedland then out of the money last time when fifth at Broome. Down in the weights on the last run and his best form puts him right in this. DYNAMIC ONE (1) finished 1.1 lengths from the winner in fourth last start after being in contention on the turn over 2200m at Broome, an improvement on his ninth at Port Hedland the run before. Beautifully placed and is sure to prove tough to beat. STAR TESTYMONY (8) is backing up quickly after finishing in the money at Broome over 2070m just seven days ago. Good effort last start and is a leading contender. LUCKY LANDING (4) missed the frame two starts ago on the dirt at Broome but followed that with a win there over 1615m a week ago. Tougher here but can sneak into the finish again.",
